{"ref":"powerup:banish","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":128,"h":112,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Banish is one of the stats in Vampire Survivors. It affects the amount of times the player can remove an item choice for the rest of the run."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once an item is banished it can no longer be offered as a level up option. If an owned item is banished or if a banished item is later picked up as a Stage item, it will remain at its current rank, but can no longer be offered upon level ups or upgraded by Treasure Chests. Banished weapons can be offered Limit Break upgrades, once the player's build is fully upgraded if Limit Break is enabled."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how many Banishes the player may have."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["25 March 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["BANISH"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 100"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Banish PowerUp increases Banish by 2 per rank, with a maximum rank of 5 after unlocking all Banish achievements. With one rank unlocked it initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 100."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Banish"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+2"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+4"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+6"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+8"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+10"]}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Each rank of PowerUp is unlocked by these achievements:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Filling 60 entries in the Collection."]},{"c":["Filling 70 entries in the Collection."]},{"c":["Filling 80 entries in the Collection."]},{"c":["Filling 90 entries in the Collection."]},{"c":["Filling 1