haracter:yoko-belnades"}," ",{"t":"Yoko","r":"character:yoko-belnades"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Rinaldo_Gandolfi.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"character:rinaldo-gandolfi"}," ",{"t":"Rinaldo","r":"character:rinaldo-gandolfi"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Mina_Hakuba.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"character:mina-hakuba"}," ",{"t":"Mina","r":"character:mina-hakuba"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Elizabeth_Bartley.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:elizabeth-bartley"}," ",{"t":"Elizabeth","r":"character:elizabeth-bartley"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Vincent_Dorin.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"character:vincent-dorin"}," ",{"t":"Vincent","r":"character:vincent-dorin"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Shanoa.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"character:shanoa"}," ",{"t":"Shanoa","r":"character:shanoa"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Shaft.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:shaft"}," ",{"t":"Shaft","r":"character:shaft"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Saint_Germain.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:saint-germain"}," ",{"t":"Saint Germain","r":"character:saint-germain"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Barlowe.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:barlowe"}," ",{"t":"Barlowe","r":"character:barlowe"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Carmilla.png","w":16,"h":24,"r":"character:carmilla"}," ",{"t":"Carmilla","r":"character:carmilla"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Count_Olrox.png","w":14,"h":24,"r":"character:count-olrox"}," ",{"t":"Olrox","r":"character:count-olrox"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Elizabeth_Bartley.png","w":24,"h":19,"r":"character:megalo-elizabeth-bartley"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Elizabeth","r":"character:megalo-elizabeth-bartley"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Olrox.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-olrox"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Olrox","r":"character:megalo-olrox"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Death.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-death"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Death","r":"character:megalo-death"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":12,"r":"character:megalo-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Dracula","r":"character:megalo-dracula"}," start with +10 Banish."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Isaac.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:isaac"}," ",{"t":"Isaac","r":"character:isaac"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Hector.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:hector"}," ",{"t":"Hector","r":"character:hector"}," start with +20 Banish."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Master_Librarian.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:master-librarian"}," ",{"t":"Master Librarian","r":"character:master-librarian"}," starts with +100 Banish."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Chaos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:chaos"}," ",{"t":"Chaos","r":"character:chaos"}," starts with +65536 Banish."]}]}]}]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Banish can be used to limit or prevent undesirable effects from an item's upgrades, such as gaining more ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," from ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"},"'s last upgrade or ",{"i":"Sprite-Skull_O'Maniac.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:skull-o-maniac"}," ",{"t":"Skull O'Maniac","r":"passive:skull-o-maniac"}," when you only need it to evolve ",{"i":"Sprite-Song_of_Mana.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:song-of-mana"}," ",{"t":"Song of Mana","r":"weapon:song-of-mana"},"."]},{"c":["Banishing common items that you are not planning on picking removes them from the item pool and increases the chances to be offered the item you want."]},{"c":["If you banish an item and pick it up in the level, it cannot be upgraded via level ups."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["As of the 1 April 2026 update picking up a banished item in the level gives the option to \"unbanish\" it. This allows it to be levelled as usual. You still have the option to pick it up normally, leaving it banished."]}]}},{"c":["Because banishing an item removes it from the item pool and picking it up in the stage allows it to be unbanished it can be efficient to banish all stage weapons and items in the Collection menu pre-run, get what you want from the item pool and then pick up and unbanish everything in the stage."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Steam_Points_Shop_-_Banish.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Banish emoticon from the Vampire Survivors ",{"t":"Steam Points Shop","x":"https://store.steampowered.com/points/shop/app/1794680"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 15 July 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["[QOL] Banish: after banishing an item, you can keep using the LevelUp menu."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 1 April 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added option to Unbanish a weapon when picking it up from the stage"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 20 October 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Each rank in Banish and Reroll now grants 2 of them instead of 1."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 7 July 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added visual reminders for Banished items"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 June 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Rerolls, Skips, and Banish disappearing from the PowerUp screen on old save files"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 8 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["1 more rank for Banish"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 24 April 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Reduced cost of Reroll, Skip, and Banish."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 5 April 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["1 more Banish"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 25 March 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The icon for Banish bears a strong resemblance to the famous Italian hand gesture ",{"t":"\"Ma cosa vuoi?\"","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Che_vuoi%3F"},", literally meaning \"Well, what do you want?\". The hand gesture can be used in a variety of contexts which can drastically alter its meaning or tone, ranging from lighthearted annoyance to bewildered confusion. The gesture is normally formed with an upward-facing palm and by touching the thumb with the base of the other fingertips, forming a pincer, and accentuated with some slight shaking. Within the context of using Banish on an item, it could be interpreted as signifying an affronted \"Well, why are you giving me this?\" or \"What am I supposed to do with this?\". The icon also bears a strong resemblance to the item ",{"t":"Vibhuti","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Vibhuti"}," from ",{"t":"Castlevania: Symphony of the Night","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania:_Symphony_of_the_Night"},", though with the hand turned upward instead of down. Combined with the aforementioned reference to the famous hand gesture, this forms a sort of visual pun, taking the Castlevania icon and tweaking it in a humorous way."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}